  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kupa D\xF6rtl\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBaz\u0131 olaylar seni adeta paralize etmi\u015F. \u0130\u015Fler
    tam istedi\u011Fin gibi gitmeyince, ne yapaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve nas\u0131l
    devam edece\u011Fini bir s\xFCre bilememi\u015Fsin {{isim}}. \u0130lerlemek i\xE7in
    baz\u0131 cevaplar arad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, bu cevaplar\u0131 ba\u015Fkalar\u0131ndan
    almak yerine kendi i\xE7ine kapan\u0131p yard\u0131ms\u0131z bulmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Cevap bulma iste\u011Fine o kadar tak\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    ki, keyif alabilece\u011Fin g\xFCnleri ve anlar\u0131 ka\xE7\u0131rm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    \xC7evrende seni de ilgilendiren geli\u015Fmeler olmas\u0131na ra\u011Fmen, t\xFCm
    olan bitene kulak t\u0131kam\u0131\u015F ve ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n sorunlar\u0131
    \xE7\xF6zmek \xFCzere hayat\u0131na adeta bir \"mola\" vermi\u015Fsin. O s\xFCre
    i\xE7erisinde yaln\u0131z kalmak, senin i\xE7in isabetli bir karar olmu\u015F.
    Bu sayede do\u011Frular\u0131 daha net g\xF6rm\xFC\u015Fs\xFCn."
